        "workedSolutionSteps": [
          "Supplier A: double 2P+3Q=7 and subtract 4P+5Q=12, giving Q2, P0.50.",
          "Supplier B: double 2P+3Q=11 and subtract 4P+5Q=19, giving Q3, P1.",
          "Price increase=5×0.50+4×1=£6.50."
