        "stem": "Consider $2x+3y=18$ and $4x+ky=36+t$. The pair (k,t) is chosen from (4,−4), (5,−3), (7,4), (8,12), (10,−4). Which option gives the complete set of pairs for which the solution has BOTH x and y as strictly positive integers?",
